From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke Craig <lacraig3@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:19:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] qapi: a weak default penguin_handle_qmp, so the tools link on
 macOS

qmp-dispatch.c declared penguin_handle_qmp as an undefined weak reference
and tested it for NULL. ELF allows that. Mach-O's ld64 refuses it, so
qemu-img, qemu-io, qemu-nbd and qemu-storage-daemon fail to link on
macOS ("Undefined symbols: _penguin_handle_qmp").

Give it a weak definition that handles nothing instead. system/penguin.c's
strong definition replaces it wherever it is linked (every system binary
and libqemu-system-*.so), on both linkers.
---
 qapi/qmp-dispatch.c | 18 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/qapi/qmp-dispatch.c b/qapi/qmp-dispatch.c
index 6ce5aa9f7a3e3886e95eb88fe5137dbe95a0b417..fb6856af932317f3d2899c318def07cea464cfac 100644
--- a/qapi/qmp-dispatch.c
+++ b/qapi/qmp-dispatch.c
@@ -26,13 +26,19 @@
 #include "qemu/main-loop.h"
 
 /*
- * Penguin QMP hook. Declared as a weak symbol so that binaries which do not
- * link system/penguin.c (e.g. qemu-nbd, qemu-storage-daemon) still link; the
- * pointer is NULL at runtime there and the hook is skipped.
+ * Penguin QMP hook. A weak default that handles nothing, so binaries which do
+ * not link system/penguin.c (e.g. qemu-nbd, qemu-storage-daemon) still link;
+ * penguin.c's strong definition replaces it where it is linked.  A weak
+ * *definition* rather than a weak reference: Mach-O's linker refuses an
+ * undefined weak reference that nothing provides.
  */
+bool penguin_handle_qmp(const char *command, const char *args, char **result);
 __attribute__((weak)) bool penguin_handle_qmp(const char *command,
                                               const char *args,
-                                              char **result);
+                                              char **result)
+{
+    return false;
+}
 
 Visitor *qobject_input_visitor_new_qmp(QObject *obj)
 {
@@ -189,8 +195,8 @@ QDict *coroutine_mixed_fn qmp_dispatch(const QmpCommandList *cmds, QObject *requ
     cmd = qmp_find_command(cmds, command);
     if (cmd == NULL) {
         /* --- PENGUIN QMP HOOK START --- */
-        /* Only present when system/penguin.c is linked (not in qemu-nbd). */
-        if (penguin_handle_qmp) {
+        /* Handles nothing unless system/penguin.c is linked (not in qemu-nbd). */
+        {
             char *hook_result = NULL;
             QDict *hook_args;
             GString *hook_args_json;
